    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for persisting a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_base_entity_set" kindref="compound">BaseEntitySet</ref></computeroutput> as a document. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The default implementation serialises the entity set to JSON and stores it via <computeroutput>IDocumentStore</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_i_doc_writer_1a416afd3de63f544163f7c83dfee7141c" kindref="member">writeDocument()</ref></computeroutput> MUST be thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
